			"notes": "New frisbees have been added:\n- Blue Fox Frisbee, made by using Sweet/Glow Berries as the 'dye.' Any fox_food will do.\n- Loyal Frisbees will return, not unlike a Loyalty Trident. Crafted by combining a Frisbee and a Heart of The Sea. Cannot be re-dyed. Cannot be dispensed.\n- Capture Frisbees catch entities much more easily. Crafted by combining a Frisbee and a Gold Ingot. Cannot be re-dyed.\n- Lasso Frisbees have both the Loyal and Capture frisbees' features. Crafted with Loyal Frisbee+Gold Ingot or Capture Frisbee+Heart of the Sea. Cannot be re-dyed. Cannot be dispensed.\n- Bomb Frisbees explode, dealing damage to nearby entities, generally destroying themselves 60% of the time. Crafted by combining a Frisbee and TNT. Cannot be re-dyed.\n\nShowcase tweaks have been mostly removed:\n- players and all mob entities can ride frisbees; no longer limited\n- dispensed frisbees can be caught and picked up; no longer limited\n- only players can catch frisbees still (mobs may be allowed to catch frisbees in a later update?)\n- rather than checking if the target is riding something, frisbees instead cannot capture if they already have passengers"
		},
